      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:202bf9edbe6aa79b2217805b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你以前不是说过想要帮助马娘实现梦想吗，我可是一直在期待的哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "719d918b12ad3b41bcef825c5c8dd63f505c50cc2b8fcde5c5a3706f86b58057",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1077/storytimeline_041077001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3317ad73978de190ffe4b73c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好歌剧和爱慕织姬，都跑得很漂亮。\n两位都有引人注目的个性与魅力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9258477b3d09dd2b920dde2ce87d5c922a4690284aa267c1d59e88f8cd2c1a6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1077/storytimeline_041077001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8e6c6f53681dc102f4b0695",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是，最令我无法移开视线的是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e1c003b0cd4bf232548a94c334801f064c7d3f0b59cc9da7ee8e0ff7d036f03",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1077/storytimeline_041077001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2fcb25f99de19b442aee08d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成田路……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70b8e952f1da3bca86fac23ea937112c02a9842a9959c2cdd0b32b78b70b9dbd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1077/storytimeline_041077001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03016afed5d2a50656184fa2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "步伐宽阔而有力，\n平稳而迅速的奔跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "90dbcfd47d9b9282c70a958f278c9b615254aefcc61dcfd558ce7fce814ddf25",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1077/storytimeline_041077001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97e6df69b4c54432795a8a37",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "毫不迷茫的奔跑在最前方，\n仿佛在呐喊，在追寻着前方光辉的未来――",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ff5c22d2c1502c726a1d79a759cbb5860ecb0fac33e008c7b1ed93099889fdb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1077/storytimeline_041077001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5291ec279f59ba19fd4fd97c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……突然兴奋起来。脑海中无数的训练计划闪过，\n心中有一种必须立刻行动起来的冲动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a107e3031eb8399b5f3641da1b186eeaa240f11fbb468a4a2500f0a71101371",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1077/storytimeline_041077001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5b7ae8629e9358dcaafd1b1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成田路",
      "source_fingerprint": "988a071d6223b7f19ac194fb48e747cae2ebec8525c415e4d4d92ec1443cca38",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1077/storytimeline_041077001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
